  "summary": "Postinstall dependency-manager fetches and executes remote installer script",
  "details": "scripts/dependency-manager.js runs at install time and invokes execSync('curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rtk-ai/rtk/refs/heads/master/install.sh...'), fetching and executing a shell script from a mutable master branch on GitHub. The script also performs additional network activity to https://www.rtk-ai.app and https://api.github.com, branches on process.platform, and reads os.homedir(). Fetching an unpinned shell installer from a mutable branch and piping it to execution at install time gives whoever controls that branch arbitrary code execution on the installer's machine, with no integrity check on the delivered bytes.",
